OL,3,GNEWSADepartment store opening bucks
OL,4,Ahigh street decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses at a family-run department store
OL,7,Fhave said they are pushing to "keep
OL,8,Ftown centres alive" after opening a new
OL,9,Fpremises in a former Marks & Spencer's
OL,10,F(M&S) store.
OL,12,FAustins began trading in Newton Abbot,
OL,13,FDevon, in 1924 and its new menswear
OL,14,Fshop opened in the town on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe independent store has converted the
OL,17,FCourtenay Street building, which closed
OL,18,Fas an M&S in 2014, into a new 8,000 sq
OL,19,Fft (743 sq m ) store and cafe.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
