OL,3,GNEWSADepartment store opening bucks
OL,4,Ahigh street decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FLily Austin, the store's executive
OL,7,Fassistant, said "in a world where out
OL,8,Fof towns are growing and growing and
OL,9,Ftown centre's are dwindling" it was
OL,10,Fgreat boost for the town.
